flowchart TD
    A[Insecure Code or Dependency] --> B[CI/CD Security Gate]
    B -->|Fail| C[Developer Remediation]
    B -->|Pass| D[Container Build]
    D --> E[Image Scan + SBOM]
    E --> F[Image Signing]
    F --> G[GitOps Deployment]
    G --> H[Admission Policy]
    H -->|Blocked| I[Policy Violation Evidence]
    H -->|Allowed| J[Hardened Kubernetes Workload]
    J --> K[Runtime Detection]
    K --> L[Retest + Report]
